n Required Essential Job Functions Wide range of job duties including, but not limited to, serving food to customers, preparing food, running a cash register, stocking supplies, keeping work area cleaned, washing dishes and cleaning the dining room as well as other general housekeeping duties. Preferred Qualifications Prefer food service experience. Work Schedule/Hours Hours vary. Some weekend work required. Number of Hours Per Week 40 Number of Months Per Year 11 Mandatory Staff Yes Physical Demands of Position To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each essential job duty satisfactorily. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable qualified individuals with disabilities to perform essential job functions. Hiring Range $15.00 per hour Pay will be commensurate with applicant competencies, budget, equity and market considerations. Posting Details Information Posting Date 02/05/2025 Closing Date 02/01/2027 Open Until Filled Yes Applicant Pool Preference Internal (Campus-Wide-Does not go out on Web) Special Instructions to Applicants This is an ongoing applicant pool. As soon as you apply, your application will be actively considered. Thank you for your interest in employment with Appalachian State University Food Services! Not Eligible for Visa Sponsorship Quick Link https://appstate.peopleadmin.com/postings/7065 Posting Number 201500024P Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Letter of Recommendation (1st doc) Do Not Use - (Historical) Veteran DD214 List of References with Contact Information Contact Us Why Work for AppState? University of North Carolina System Employment Careers with the State of North Carolina To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
