 Orientation Leader Work Schedule/Hours Monday – Friday, 8:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m., with some evening hours possible. Number of Hours Per Week 30-40 Number of Months Per Year 5 Mandatory Staff No Physical Demands of Position None Hiring Range $11.00-$16.00 Pay will be commensurate with applicant competencies, budget, equity and market considerations. Posting Details Information Posting Date 05/28/2024 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Applicant Pool Preference Internal (Campus-Wide-Does not go out on Web) Special Instructions to Applicants Not Eligible for Visa Sponsorship Quick Link https://appstate.peopleadmin.com/postings/46283 Posting Number 201500897P Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Contact Us Why Work for AppState? University of North Carolina System Employment Careers with the State of North Carolina To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
