      "description": "Appalachian State University Employment Opportunities | Food Service Technician/Cashier/Housekeeper-Pool Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help AppState HR Home Page Veteran Recruitment Resources Food Service Technician/Cashier/Housekeeper-Pool Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark this Posting link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Application Deadline: All applications must be submitted electronically by 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time on the closing date indicated in the posting. For positions listed as Open Until Filled, applications will be accepted until the position is filled. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Please provide a minimum of 3 references on the application. Applications will be reviewed by the Campus Dining supervisors based on employment needs. A Food Service supervisor will contact prospective candidates to provide more details on the temporary position. Posting Details Work experience or education that is NOT included on the application will NOT be considered when screening your application. Please include ALL work experience and education on the application to ensure that you receive the appropriate credit toward qualification for this position. Request to Recruit Working Title Food Service Technician/Cashier/Housekeeper-Pool Location Boone, NC Position Number N32310 Department Campus Dining - Administration - 170310 Position Summary Information Minimum Qualifications Experience in food preparation or service activities in a commercial kitchen; or an equivalent combination of training and experience. License/Certification Required Essential Job Functions Join our team in Food Services that provides quality food items in a variety of dining venues. A great place to work and great people to serve. Wide range of job duties including, but not limited to, serving food to customers, preparing food, running a cash register, stocking supplies, keeping work area cleaned, washing dishes and cleaning the dining room as well as other general housekeeping duties. Venues include: Sanford Commons, McAlister’s Deli, McAlister’s Select, Rivers Street Café, Cascades, Park Place Café, Chick-Fil-A, and the Bake Shop. Preferred Qualifications Prefer food service experience. Work Schedule/Hours Schedule varies depending on business need and on unit. Some weekend work may be required. Please note: Temporary positions and work schedules will vary from position to position depending on department’s needs. Hours per week may be full time or part time. Number of Hours Per Week 20-40 (based on need) Number of Months Per Year 11 Mandatory Staff No Physical Demands of Position To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each essential job duty satisfactorily. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable qualified individuals with disabilities to perform essential job functions. Hiring Range $14.00-$15.00 per hour Pay will be commensurate with applicant competencies, budget, equity and market considerations. Posting Details Information Posting Date 06/30/2020 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Applicant Pool Preference External (Post on the Web) Special Instructions to Applicants Please provide a minimum of 3 references on the application. Applications will be reviewed by the Campus Dining supervisors based on employment needs. A Food Service supervisor will contact prospective candidates to provide more details on the temporary position. Not Eligible for Visa Sponsorship Quick Link https://appstate.peopleadmin.com/postings/16844 Posting Number 201500331P Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Contact Us Why Work for AppState? University of North Carolina System Employment Careers with the State of North Carolina To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
