      "description": "Appalachian State University Employment Opportunities | Food Service Technician / Sanford Commons Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help AppState HR Home Page Veteran Recruitment Resources Food Service Technician / Sanford Commons Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark this Posting link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Application Deadline: All applications must be submitted electronically by 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time on the closing date indicated in the posting. For positions listed as Open Until Filled, applications will be accepted until the position is filled. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. **This is an ongoing applicant pool. As soon as you apply, your application will be actively considered. Thank you for your interest in employment with Appalachian State University Food Services!** Posting Details Work experience or education that is NOT included on the application will NOT be considered when screening your application. Please include ALL work experience and education on the application to ensure that you receive the appropriate credit toward qualification for this position. Request to Recruit Working Title Food Service Technician / Sanford Commons Location Boone, NC Position Number N32340 Department Campus Dining - Sanford Commons - 170380 Position Summary Information Minimum Qualifications Experience in food preparation or service activities in a commercial kitchen, or an equivalent combination of training and experience. License/Certification Required Essential Job Functions Wide range of job duties including, but not limited to, serving food to customers, preparing food, running a cash register, stocking supplies, keeping work area cleaned, washing dishes and cleaning the dining room as well as other general housekeeping duties. Preferred Qualifications Prefer food service experience. Work Schedule/Hours Hours vary. Some weekend work required. Number of Hours Per Week 40 Number of Months Per Year 11 Mandatory Staff Yes Physical Demands of Position Must be physical capable to move quickly and efficiently and endure very warm temperatures (at times). Good stamina. Must be able to lift up to 50 lbs without difficulty. Hiring Range $15.00 Pay will be commensurate with applicant competencies, budget, equity and market considerations. Posting Details Information Posting Date 05/30/2025 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Applicant Pool Preference Internal (Campus-Wide-Does not go out on Web) Special Instructions to Applicants This is an ongoing applicant pool. As soon as you apply, your application will be actively considered. Thank you for your interest in employment with Appalachian State University Food Services! Not Eligible for Visa Sponsorship Quick Link https://appstate.peopleadmin.com/postings/6925 Posting Number 201500020P Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Do Not Use - (Historical) Veteran DD214 Contact Us Why Work for AppState? University of North Carolina System Employment Careers with the State of North Carolina To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
